      ],
      "source": "https://villageofpalmyra.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad in 1852 helped Palmyra grow by enabling faster transport of agricultural goods to Milwaukee.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
