      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/palmyra_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Palmyra is home to the historic Tisch House Hotel, which was originally built as the town's first hotel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/palmyra_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Palmyra Springs Sanitarium once offered luxury baths and electro-shock massages in a massive four-story brick building.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
