      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmyra%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Great Geyser Spring in Palmyra features crystal-blue water that was once believed to have therapeutic remedial value.",
